8348	    /// The enforcement predicates that drive `hb_checkpoint`: an anchor is
8349	    /// reached at exactly its `SyscallCount` on the right thread, an AFTER anchor
8350	    /// of a Hard edge is blocked until its BEFORE anchor fires, and firing the
8351	    /// BEFORE anchor opens the gate. This mirrors the two-thread race validated
